#3900
On the Widmans River~
   As the Widmans River flows toward Elrhinn it gathers speed, whisking
you along between high banks crowned by the golden trees of Pelarinne.
Leaves drift past on the current, and the water chuckles against your
hull.  The gloomy forest to the west makes you long for the relative
safety of the town.  Downstream lies the east, and upstream the river
bends west toward a small bank.
~
