#3903
The Scenic Route~
   The dark forest of Pelarinne recedes behind you to the northeast as
the river widens and slows.  Reeds grow thick along the banks, and
herons stalk the shallows.  The river continues west toward the delta,
where you can just make out a large island rising from the water.
