#3904
The Swift River Delta~
   You are at the edge of the river delta, where the river spreads out
on its way to the sea.  The water here is black.  Deep.  Dark.  Deadly.
The tidal swells sweep you around and around, up and down, and the smell
of salt is strong on the wind.  Channels lead north, south and west, and
the river runs back east.
~
