The Lane Of The Lying~
   Bodies lie everywhere along this lane: commoner and peasant, duke and
duchess, all alike in death.  The gods will not hear you call here, and
so they will not answer you.  To the south the path ends at a dark cave
entrance in the hillside, and a sign has been posted beside it.  To the
north lies the water.
